~ start

Innkeeper: Hi! Welcome to the tavern!
Innkeeper: The realm is going to have a lot of visitors in the next days! The launch of the game is going to be a fantastic moment for everybody! 
Innkeeper: But I'm feeling a bit anxious... [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/conversation_innkeeper_sad.png]
Innkeeper: My sight has gotten worse, and I am not able to read the only thing that I actually have to read to the visitors, the menu of the tavern! [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/conversation_innkeeper_angry.png]
Innkeeper: If only there was somebody that could help me... [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/conversation_innkeeper_sad.png]
Innkeeper: What? You are the developer of the game?? [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/conversation_innkeeper_surprised.png]
Innkeeper: Please help me, creator!
: Here you have the menu. As you can see, it is not clearly visible. [#minigame_menu]
: Imagine the poor innkeeper, that has cataracts! [#activate_shader]
: Try to help him by fixing the menu! Read more about the problem in the manual. You can open it by clicking on the icon on the right, or by pressing the {M} key [#show_debug]
=> END

~ fail_reaction
Innkeeper: Mmmh, no, I still can't see properly...
=> END

~ win_reaction
Innkeeper: Oh! Now I can see clearly! [#deactivate_shader]
Innkeeper: You are my saviour! Thank you! [#close_minigame] [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/conversation_innkeeper_happy.png]
Innkeeper: I bet there are other people that would really need your help!
Innkeeper: Actually, I remember hearing some really noisy visitors the other day, they were speaking of some problem in the castle... [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/conversation_innkeeper_angry.png]
Innkeeper: But I know you will help also them, right? [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/conversation_innkeeper_happy.png]
Innkeeper: See you soon, creator!
=> END

~ already_helped
Innkeeper: [[Pork Stew: 10c| Roasted Chicken: 15c|Craft Dark Ale: 3c|Pizza Grandiosa: 200c|Spaghetti con le angilt: 100000c]]... Hey! You still here?? Go to the castle!
=> END